WEBVTT

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.700
In the early 21st century,

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.760
20XX Tokyo

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:19.670
the Gates opened without warning.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:11.320
From within the Gates, which would later 
come to be known as "Black Points,"

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:14.300
bizarre monsters from 
beyond our world appeared.

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:37.050
These monsters brought 
death wherever they went.

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:39.470
Washington DC

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.160
And in less than seven days,

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:42.350
Paris

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:43.390
humanity had lost any 
means of fighting back,

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.970
Buenos Aires

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:47.120
and the planet was engulfed 
in the darkness of despair.

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:47.980
Pretoria

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.630
As the unending nightmare dragged on,

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:59.510
people came to call the creatures 
that came from the Black Points

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.940
"Zillions of Enemy X"...

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:08.760
or Z/X.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.000
December 31st 20:23 
Kobe Northern Mountains

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:29.000
Three years have passed 
since the Gates appeared.

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:35.290
Go, Tyranno!

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:36.940
Sera Kurashiki

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:37.090
Squash 'em all!

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:39.990
Ultimate Dinosaur  Orichalcum Tyranno

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:50.750
Permission.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.430
Error adjustment: +2.

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.080
Energy fully charged.

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.580
Target, locked on.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:10.790
Shoot!

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:14.630
Tyranno!

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:31.870
What?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.810
Sword Sniper  Rigel

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.440
That pea shooter won't hurt us!

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:53.960
Azumi, can you hear me?

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.330
Yes.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:56.680
What's the enemy?

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:57.970
A Gigantic.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:00.590
Definitely a Red World Z/X.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.930
So the Red World is invading?

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.160
I can't say for sure.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.920
I need to find out what the other Z/X is.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:10.120
Azumi Kagamihara

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:10.600
I see.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.330
I'll chop you to pieces!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.000
December 31st 20:31 Akashi Strait Bridge

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.000
Your attacks can't hurt me!

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.280
The Black Blade  Sieger

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.280
Not bad, upstart samurai.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.370
My name is Rindo.

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:25.610
Katana Samurai  Rindo

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:26.160
And I am no mere upstart!

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.030
Yeah, I hear you!

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.310
You actually kept up with Rindo.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:47.220
Chitose Aoba

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.220
That Z/X of yours isn't bad.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:48.970
You too.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.970
Ayase Kamiyugi

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:51.970
You're not bad for an 
elementary school kid.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:56.480
I am nineteen!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.860
Nineteen? And you're that flat?

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.830
Rindo, slice that bearcat apart!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:06.610
Understood.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:08.610
I'm no cat!

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:09.780
I'm a panther!

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:19.070
<i>A Z/X from the Green World 
that appeared from the west.</i>

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:22.800
<i>A Red World Z/X from the north.</i>

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:26.850
<i>For Z/X from two worlds 
to appear at the same time...</i>

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.030
<i>Is it a coincidence?</i>

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.890
<i>Or are they working together?</i>

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:33.970
<i>Either way...</i>

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.030
<i>They can't be allowed into Kobe.</i>

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:42.680
And where is that idiot 
when we need him?

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:44.570
December 31st 20:37 Cafe Broccolo

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.570
Welcome.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.570
Right this way.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.410
<i>What are you doing, Asuka Tennoji?!</i>

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:54.080
Asuka Tennoji

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.330
<i>Now is not the time for this!</i>

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.420
Will this seat be all right?

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.090
Yes.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.340
Call me when you're ready to order.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.840
<i>Are you listening, Asuka?</i>

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.510
I can hear you fine.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.750
<i>Then...</i>

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:14.850
I can't do anything about it. I'm at work.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.730
Which is more important? 
Your job or Kobe?

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.500
Both of them!

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:24.480
December 31st 20:45 
Kobe Northern Mountains

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.860
Found you!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:33.450
I won't let anybody get in our way!

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:40.000
Oh, come on! Keep still!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.390
Are you hurt, Azumi?

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:43.570
No.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.000
I'm glad.

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:48.510
Thank you.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:56.010
Looks like they're really 
going at it over there, too.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.110
<i>A decoy?</i>

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.950
<i>Sieger, get over here!</i>

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.660
Huh? Why?

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.030
I was just at the good part!

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:15.620
Just do it!

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:19.500
You're a selfish little princess, as always.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:29.340
Hey! Are you running away?

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:33.260
If you want another round, 
I'm up for it anytime.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.070
But...

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.350
December 31st 21:01 Cafe Broccolo

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.350
Okay, see you!

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.480
Oh, sorry, Aina.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.150
No, I'm fine.

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:48.840
Aina Mikage

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:49.070
But why the hurry, Tennoji?

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:51.820
I'm off to be a hero!

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.840
Bye!

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:09.530
Activate!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.800
Your shift's finally over?

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:23.910
The Proud  Fierte

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:26.000
You shouldn't have come 
to work on New Year's Eve.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.750
Fierte, you're an angel.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.130
Do you even know why New 
Year's Eve is important?

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:36.370
More importantly, are 
you going north or west?

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.400
North!

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:38.510
Understood.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:40.740
Wait a second!

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:43.910
We need every second 
we can get right now!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.000
Fierte, I...

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:51.710
I hate heights!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.070
December 31st 21:14 
Kobe Northern Mountains

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.740
Are you okay, Azumi?

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:12.570
Yeah.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.150
It's over!

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:24.580
Sorry we're late.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:25.750
You...

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:26.580
Asuka!

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.450
What are you doing here?

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.740
I came to save you.

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:32.590
There's no need to be so mean.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.530
Nobody asked for your help.

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:36.110
Well, that's true.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:39.350
But do you see that hospital?

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.600
My mom's there.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.060
Your mom?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:48.350
So I can't let these nasty guys 
get anywhere near it.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.100
Sanctifying Light!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:03.120
What, what? What happened, Tyranno?!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.500
Now, Rigel!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.120
Aim for the feet!

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.620
Don't give me orders!

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:24.890
Darn it! They won't get away with this!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.540
Alexander!

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:32.900
Nine Worthies  Alexander

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:32.900
Sera, you and the others 
are to proceed to the city.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.020
But...

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:37.020
You would disobey me?

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.270
What did Mikado say?

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:42.140
He is my strategist.

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:45.150
He would not disagree with me.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:46.610
Roger.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:48.300
Let's go, Tyranno.

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:52.530
Uh-oh.

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.730
They're heading for the city.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:56.120
What do we do?

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.860
Stop them, of course!

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.680
That would be a problem.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:00.890
Who's there?

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.680
Mikado Kurosaki

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.310
A Red World Z/X user?

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:08.810
Indeed.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.220
Then the Red World is behind this attack?

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:15.820
Me?

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:17.820
Unlisted Number

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:19.820
Ayasaka?

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.960
Don't call me by my first name.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:22.820
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:25.500
<i>So what's up? I'm kinda busy here.</i>

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.080
Just listen to me.

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.170
The attacks from the north 
and west are decoys.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:30.580
The real force is somewhere else.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.420
<i>Somewhere else? Where?</i>

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.470
The ocean!

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:34.680
The ocean?

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:38.440
It's too late to do anything about it now.

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:42.050
Or so I'd like to say.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.270
But there was no need for 
decoys in the first place.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:48.970
It looks like the White World 
has abandoned this town.

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:53.180
The White World abandoned the town?

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:54.950
What does that mean?

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.380
I don't know myself.

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:00.610
You.

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:02.500
Me?

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.770
What's your name?

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:06.120
Asuka Tennoji.

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:12.760
How would you like to help us, Asuka Tennoji?

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.190
No way!

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:15.330
I see.

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:17.420
Unfortunate.

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:23.180
Farewell.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:23.930
Wait!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:26.550
We're following them, Fierte!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.470
Right!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.340
No! Too high up!

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:31.930
Rigel!

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:32.860
Yes.

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.000
Permission.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:40.570
What's that?

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.480
<i>All green at Point Whiskey.</i>

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:46.560
<i>Approach course secured.</i>

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:48.050
<i>Maintain altitude 
until further orders.</i>

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:51.000
<i>Point Bravo, report on the status 
of the Nara Black Point.</i>

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.690
<i>This is Hermes. We're not 
seeing anything unusual.</i>

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:54.550
<i>Roger.</i>

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.910
<i>HQ to Chimera. Initiate attack.</i>

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:01.340
<i>Rendezvous with the landing 
party at 21:20. Repeat...</i>

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.340
<i>Rendezvous with the 
landing party at 21:20.</i>

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:06.740
<i>Engines at full.</i>

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.550
<i>Begin operation Code KOBE.</i>

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:12.430
<i>Deploying landing craft.</i>

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:15.290
<i>No enemies detected on the coast.</i>

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.850
<i>Approaching target point.</i>

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.880
<i>All crew, prepare for landing.</i>

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:24.180
<i>Mechanized infantry brigades Mary, 
Bravo, and Charlie have landed.</i>

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:26.110
<i>Everyone stay on alert.</i>

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.880
<i>Head immediately to target point F23.</i>

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:29.620
<i>Mary, roger.</i>

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.160
<i>Bravo, roger.</i>

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.740
<i>Charlie, roger.</i>

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.410
Heavy infantry, advance!

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:57.640
 Do they really intend to invade our world?

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:56.250
Four Archangels  Michael

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.230
I don't know.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:01.690
Four Archangels  Gabriel

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:02.740
With Raphael missing,

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:06.710
we don't want to enter 
into unnecessary conflict.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.660
I'd like to just wait and see, but...

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:15.410
Either way, we need Uriel to make a decision.

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.240
Indeed...

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:21.460
It is unthinkable that, in a situation 
such as this, he does not show himself.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.170
He needs to understand

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:28.630
that he is the leader of this world.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.050
Yes.

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:36.810
December 31st 21:28 Kobe Port

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:39.930
It's time.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:42.940
We will now begin our advance.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:46.440
Kobe will belong to me, Mikado Kurosaki!

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.450
Hold it right there!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.150
Hold it! Hold it! Hold it! Hold it! Hold it!

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:52.990
Hold it!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.990
I won't let you have this city!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:06.480
If you'd kept quiet, you 
wouldn't have had to get hurt.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:07.640
Alexander.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.510
Very well.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.450
Behold my power!

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.590
Asuka!

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:55.970
Asuka? Asuka!

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:59.310
Hang in there, Asuka!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:02.360
You escaped my attack unharmed?

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:03.560
Impressive.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:07.020
What is your name?

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:11.570
Fierte, the Proud.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.100
Fierte...

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:14.890
I don't know that name.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:17.480
Do you know it, Mikado?

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:18.440
No.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:21.580
But her power matches that 
of the Twelve Apostles.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.580
Or perhaps exceeds it.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:27.590
I'd have preferred to 
have her join us, but...

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:31.990
That only makes her all the 
more worthy of defeating.

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:33.170
Wait!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:40.410
What are you going to do with Kobe?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:45.880
Our lives were finally 
getting back to normal.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.330
I won't let anybody ruin that.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.730
Anybody!

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:53.470
What will you do, then?

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:55.160
Stop you with all my power!

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.250
What is that?

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:19.510
A week before Mikado 
Kurosaki's landing at Kobe.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:18.990
December 24th, 12:10 Kobe

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:30.590
It was Christmas Eve, and the city 
of Kobe was bright and cheerful,

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:33.500
despite the fact that it was 
still in the midst of its recovery.

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:34.570
December 24th 12:26 Kiyozono Hospital

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.820
Well, I'll be going.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.650
You're working again?

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:41.160
It's Christmas Eve.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.080
Don't you have a girlfriend or something?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.920
I don't have the time or the money.

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:48.080
My brother's so stingy.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.790
What are you talking about?

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:54.980
Yamato's paying for all 
my medical expenses,

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:57.860
and all your tuition fees at high school.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:00.270
You shouldn't say things like that.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:03.600
Sure, he's paying for my living 
expenses and my tuition.

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:08.020
But why do I only get 500 
yen a month for allowance?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.410
If you want spending money, earn it yourself.

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:12.610
That's his rule.

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:27.170
I don't have time for this!

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:32.360
December 24th 12:42 Kobe

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.120
Okay, I've gotta chance it!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:47.580
Hey, I'm sorry, but could you move?

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:57.290
That's a strange outfit.

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:00.450
I am the Shrine Priestess of the Dragon.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:01.980
A shrine priestess?

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:04.800
But it's Christmas Eve.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:07.080
The gods of Japan have the night off.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:09.930
You.

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:15.460
Would you please protect 
this world for me?

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.140
Huh? What are you talki—

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.970
I will give you this.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:24.880
That's...

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:26.430
Yes.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.060
A Card Device.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.260
It will enable you to 
capture and control a Z/X.

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:33.610
It is the one hope humanity has created

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:37.440
that will enable them to resist the Z/X.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:40.450
Don't tease your elders, little lady.

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:45.160
Only soldiers and police 
have Card Devices.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.450
You couldn't...

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:51.130
Protect this world, Asuka Tennoji.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.830
Huh...?

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.220
December 24th 12:48 Kobe

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.090
December 24th 20:15 Cafe Broccolo

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.470
Um...

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.510
What, you're still here?

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:16.940
Um, what's your name again?

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:19.820
Aina. Aina Mikage.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.280
Oh, that's right.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.870
You can go home, Mikage.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.760
I'll take care of the rest.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:28.700
You can't keep your boyfriend 
waiting on Christmas Eve!

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:30.950
I don't have a...

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.460
Go on, get going!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.670
W-Wait!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.500
Okay, time to finish this up!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.530
December 24th 22:48 Tenousaka

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:51.830
It's so cold!

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:14.350
H-Hey!

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:18.330
She's so light...

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:31.390
Blood?

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:34.690
Put that angel down.

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:45.780
Or I'll kill you, too.

00:21:49.610 --> 00:21:51.530
Asuka Tennoji, age 17.

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:56.810
Faced with a wounded angel 
and a girl with a black Z/X,

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:59.020
he simply stares in shock.

00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:04.550
At this point, he was still 
just an unfortunate boy.

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:08.170
Why is this happening?

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:43.680
Next time on <i>Z/X Ignition</i>:

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:55.580
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:44.490 --> 00:23:45.700
Phase 2.

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:51.740
What color is the future 
awaiting Asuka Tennoji?
